\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces South Lhonak source diagnostics. (a,b) Nearest selected pre/post optical acquisitions, 26 September and 9 October, shown as B11/B08/B03 false color with common reflectance display scale $[0,0.4]$; white indicates excluded QA. (c,d) ROI empirical distributions of the three bands and two indices, with solid pre-event and dashed post-event curves; the index axis is symmetric-logarithmic. (e--h) Raw dB and signed linear VV/VH from 1 September only, on ellipsoid tiepoint geometry. Signed noise-support gaps remain missing. Color normalization affects display only. These are query-ROI measurements, not validated water-only or terrain-corrected comparisons.}}{4}{figure.caption.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:spatial}{{2}{4}{South Lhonak source diagnostics. (a,b) Nearest selected pre/post optical acquisitions, 26 September and 9 October, shown as B11/B08/B03 false color with common reflectance display scale $[0,0.4]$; white indicates excluded QA. (c,d) ROI empirical distributions of the three bands and two indices, with solid pre-event and dashed post-event curves; the index axis is symmetric-logarithmic. (e--h) Raw dB and signed linear VV/VH from 1 September only, on ellipsoid tiepoint geometry. Signed noise-support gaps remain missing. Color normalization affects display only. These are query-ROI measurements, not validated water-only or terrain-corrected comparisons}{figure.caption.3}{}}
